Chase in the underworld

There are 5 powerful enemies chasing/looking after a different unit.

Goal is to either protect the unit or defeat the 5 powerful enemies

There are other climbers on this floor

Everyone on the floor fails if they failed to protect the unit

The unit will be running around in a fix pattern, the 5 powerful will move around randomly (if they met in the same area the unit will get damaged and then it teleports away to a random location)

There are clues around the areas to figure out the weakness of each enemy
like each horseman can target the horse to making them unmounted.
specific weaknesses (to each 1-4th)
5th horseman can only be defeated once all other horseman are defeated

1st Horseman (White Horse): Often identified as Conquest, 
2nd Horseman (Red Horse): Represents War,
3rd Horseman (Black Horse): Represents Famine, 
4th Horseman (Pale Horse): Identified directly as Death, 
5th Horseman (Gold Horse): Everything evil


